          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.75.080:block:9",
          "start": 1252
        },
        "quote": "(2) Such inventory shall not include goods ordered in contemplation of conducting a sale regulated under this chapter. Any unusual purchase or additions to the stock of goods of the business hereby effected within 30 days before the filing of an application under this chapter shall be deemed to be of such character. (Code 1981 § 37-35. Code 1995 § 30-157.)",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.75.080:block:9#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
